    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Chertovica is a dark fantasy boomershooter focused on melee combat.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lilith</strong> herself has woken you up from your eternal sleep. Demons are upon your world and you are the one who is going to stop them. Will you pick the <strong>Light</strong> and become a <strong>Holy Knight</strong>, or <strong>Darkness</strong> and gain the power of <strong>Vampire Lord</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/b5a250ba62c4b2b1fabb306d34ba0482.poster.avif?t=1748761332\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/b5a250ba62c4b2b1fabb306d34ba0482.webm?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/b5a250ba62c4b2b1fabb306d34ba0482.mp4?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsheathe your sword, load your pistol</strong> and obliterate your way through possessed ex-humans, divo\u017eienky, rabid wolves and other vermin seeking to transform this world to a proper hellscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/64c2618154592a787e47aa923c3606ac.poster.avif?t=1748761332\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/64c2618154592a787e47aa923c3606ac.webm?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/64c2618154592a787e47aa923c3606ac.mp4?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets hidden behind half-crumbling walls. Explore dark catacombs of despair or old monastery grounds which were supposed to be your final resting ground. Experience the thick atmosphere of a demon invasion, but are the horrors coming from hell, or are you, the horror, coming to hell?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/7f74b5de622c013f1af57ba7847632ee.poster.avif?t=1748761332\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/7f74b5de622c013f1af57ba7847632ee.webm?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/7f74b5de622c013f1af57ba7847632ee.mp4?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Chertovica is a dark fantasy boomershooter focused on melee combat.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lilith</strong> herself has woken you up from your eternal sleep. Demons are upon your world and you are the one who is going to stop them. Will you pick the <strong>Light</strong> and become a <strong>Holy Knight</strong>, or <strong>Darkness</strong> and gain the power of <strong>Vampire Lord</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/b5a250ba62c4b2b1fabb306d34ba0482.poster.avif?t=1748761332\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/b5a250ba62c4b2b1fabb306d34ba0482.webm?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/b5a250ba62c4b2b1fabb306d34ba0482.mp4?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsheathe your sword, load your pistol</strong> and obliterate your way through possessed ex-humans, divo\u017eienky, rabid wolves and other vermin seeking to transform this world to a proper hellscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/64c2618154592a787e47aa923c3606ac.poster.avif?t=1748761332\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/64c2618154592a787e47aa923c3606ac.webm?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/64c2618154592a787e47aa923c3606ac.mp4?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets hidden behind half-crumbling walls. Explore dark catacombs of despair or old monastery grounds which were supposed to be your final resting ground. Experience the thick atmosphere of a demon invasion, but are the horrors coming from hell, or are you, the horror, coming to hell?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/7f74b5de622c013f1af57ba7847632ee.poster.avif?t=1748761332\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/7f74b5de622c013f1af57ba7847632ee.webm?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/7f74b5de622c013f1af57ba7847632ee.mp4?t=1748761332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "All the cherts are getting married tonight, on a night called Chertovica. Grab your axe, chug down your last tankard, and kick them back to hell where they belong in this retro, melee-centric boomer shooter.",
